<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107034" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπείλλω</span></b> , or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπίλλω</span></b>  (both forms in codd.), aor. perh.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπῖλα,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw in, contract,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρὰν δ᾽ ὑπίλασ᾽ ὑπὸ λεοντόπουν
					βάσιν καθέζετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					540
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπίλλας</span> codd.<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπήλας</span> codd.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπείλλει</span> codd.<i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδεὶς μοχθηρὸς ἄπορος ὑπείλλων καὶ
					ὑποστέλλων ἀχρηματίας οἴκτῳ τὸ δίκην δοῦναι
					παρακρουέσθω</span>”
				<i>evading,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.348
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>keep shut,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοὶ δ᾽ ὑπίλλουσιν στόμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					509
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
